@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User A (Caller)" as A
participant "Signaling Server\n(Socket.IO)" as S
actor "User B (Callee)" as B

== Giai đoạn 1: Gia nhập phòng (Joining) ==
A -> S: Emit "room:join" {email, roomID}
B -> S: Emit "room:join" {email, roomID}
S -> A: Emit "room:joined" {email: A}
S -> B: Emit "room:joined" {email: B}
S -> A: Emit "user:joined" {email: B}
S -> B: Emit "user:joined" {email: A}

== Giai đoạn 2: Khởi tạo cuộc gọi (Offer) ==
A -> A: Create RTCPeerConnection
A -> A: Create Offer (SDP)
A -> A: Set LocalDescription(Offer)
A -> S: Emit "user:call" {to: B, offer}
S -> B: Forward "incoming:call" {from: A, offer}

== Giai đoạn 3: Trả lời (Answer) ==
B -> B: Set RemoteDescription(Offer)
B -> B: Create RTCPeerConnection
B -> B: Create Answer (SDP)
B -> B: Set LocalDescription(Answer)
B -> S: Emit "call:accepted" {to: A, answer}
S -> A: Forward "call:accepted" {from: B, answer}
A -> A: Set RemoteDescription(Answer)

== Giai đoạn 4: Trao đổi ứng viên ICE (Traversing NAT) ==
note over A, B: ICE Candidates exchange typically happens in parallel\nwith Offer/Answer exchange
A -> S: Emit "peer:candidate" {candidate}
S -> B: Forward "peer:candidate"
B -> B: AddIceCandidate()

B -> S: Emit "peer:candidate" {candidate}
S -> A: Forward "peer:candidate"
A -> A: AddIceCandidate()

== Giai đoạn 5: Kết nối P2P (Peer-to-Peer) ==
A <-> B: <color:red>Direct Media Stream (Video/Audio)</color>
A <-> B: <color:blue>RTCDataChannel (Chat/File Transfer)</color>
@enduml
